g-preview/_img/1e106d54b9a1553b.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/1e106d54b9a1553b.webp 720w","h1wphhcy6yp7nqlepnpro1rs8","亚马逊提醒卖家确认进口备案人以应对美国进口新规","亚马逊发布通知，指出基于EO 14411的美国进口新规则正处审查阶段，可能较快实施，建议卖家提前确认进口备案人（IOR）身份。使用外国IOR的卖家受影响最大，需准备CTPAT资质核查、保证金类型确认等；美国IOR卖家需关注资产覆盖与合规状态。目前无变更生效，但建议本周内联系货运代理或报关行核实IOR信息并制定预案。",{"_117":164},"2026-10-20T10:04:52.000Z","2026-10-20T10:37:38.058Z",[113,115,114],{"_109":114,"_111":163},[567],{"_97":98,"_99":568,"_101":569,"_103":570,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5,"_108":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/7be074ee6d4619f3.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/7be074ee6d4619f3.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/7be074ee6d4619f3.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/7be074ee6d4619f3.webp 720w","bu35r2cq04j2k6ekvgkgjg85x","亚马逊卖家账户因法律实体变更被关联至未知账户","亚马逊卖家反馈账户被标记违反多账户政策并关联至陌生账户。该情况可能发生在从个体户变更为 LLC 等业务过渡期间，建议卖家通过“设置-账户信息-法律实体”路径核查自身注册主体状态。",{"_117":390},"2026-10-20T15:00:01.000Z","2026-10-20T15:05:41.743Z",[113,114],[],{"_380":381,"_382":383,"_384":385,"_386":387,"_93":580,"_389":-5},[],"ri2c0kf5degkiq70fko9be4lt","亚马逊卖家称拥有自有品牌仍收到Listing下架通知","ASGTG社区分享一卖家案例，该卖家声称拥有并制造自有品牌超10年且已备案Brand Registry，却收到亚马逊通知将于10月28日移除其Listing，理由是品牌不再符合第三方卖家资格。亚马逊表示具有Brand Representative角色的卖家可继续销售，但此规则让实际品牌所有者感到困惑，发帖人询问是否有其他类似情况以评估影响范围。",{"_117":433},"2026-10-20T15:17:04.000Z","2026-10-20T15:36:44.067Z",[135,597,114],[],{"_380":422,"_382":423,"_384":424,"_386":425,"_93":590,"_389":-5},[591],{"_97":98,"_99":592,"_101":593,"_103":594,"_105":595,"_106":596,"_107":-5,"_108":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1083,841,"品牌","a9hkquqo85uk3i8c0kxxqezf8","亚马逊卖家账号转发卖家对平台退货与费用的批评","亚马逊卖家账号AmazonASGTG转发@BowTiedBroke的帖文，称其为“传奇”。被转发帖文作者自述在亚马逊销售15年，认为这可能是最后一年，并批评平台在退货纠纷中偏向买家、费用高企（包括低库存费），以及小卖家面临竞争压力；这些均为该卖家的个人说法，本站尚未独立核验。",{"_117":433},"2026-10-20T18:02:23.000Z","2026-10-20T18:11:41.348Z",[113,114,255],18,[],{"_380":422,"_382":423,"_384":424,"_386":425,"_93":608,"_389":609},[],{"_380":610,"_382":610,"_451":611,"_453":-5},"BowTiedBroke","After 15 yrs, I think this will be my last year selling on Amazon. It has now become a DEN OF THIEVES. Buyers purchase an expensive item, receive it, claim it's damaged, return it (but what the buyer returns is usually some broken junk they had laying around their house, while they keep what was in the box they received). Amazon issues a refund to the buyer and the seller can be out thousands of dollars. And Amazon ALWAYS sides with the buyer, rarely the seller.  \n\nIt is also now overrun by Chinese sellers hijacking small mom & pop listings & getting take down orders on the mom & pop listings as I outline in my post below from 2025. And there is literally nothing the small US businesses can do to rectify it. \n\nAnd now the fees they charge almost make it impossible to make a profit. One absurd fee they rolled out is a \"Low inventory fee\". If you run out of stock of an item because it sells fast, you get charged a fee FOR BEING OUT OF STOCK. Heaven forbid your supplier is out of stock, or you just don't have any extra inventory of that item, they'll still whack you with a fee each month for not having inventory at their fulfillment center for them to ship out. Coupled with all the other fees they charge, you can easily hit 40% of your sales revenue going straight to Amazon in fees now. That doesn't include YOUR costs, like cost of goods, packaging, etc. \n\nAfter 15 years, to me, it's just really not worth it anymore. It's been a good run but they've made it almost impossible for small third party sellers to make a profit. They prioritized the low cost Chinese knock offs years ago and now seem to prioritize complete thievery all in the name of Bezos' original mission of being the \"Earth’s most customer-centric company.” The first and most important principle of Amazon's Leadership Principles is \"Customer Obsession\". \n\nBut I'll add one tweak: \"Customer Obsession: Even if the customer is a blatant thief\"   \n\n(A recent screenshot of a discussion on their seller forums)","k019k6agv4ojxo64yc6acny7k","美国IOR监管趋严，亚马逊提醒卖家自查进口主体","亚马逊向美国站卖家发送风险提示邮件，提醒核实发货使用的IOR（进口备案人）属于美国本土实体还是境外实体。此次变动源于2026年6月3日签署的第14411号行政令《加强海关执法》，要求国土安全部与CBP在2026年11月30日前完成进口商资质条款修订。","原文梳理了美国IOR新规对进口商资质和保证金的收紧要求，并给出了卖家自查货代配套IOR属性的具体步骤。",{"_117":136},"2026-10-20T18:19:00.000Z","2026-10-21T02:23:12.996Z",[113,114,115],74,{"_109":627,"_111":112},[623],{"_97":98,"_99":624,"_101":625,"_103":626,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5,"_108":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp 720w","北美电商资讯","mvgctlme911hgedejhturnhzg","亚马逊群发“NWD品牌移除”通知系系统误发，持有品牌代表角色卖家可忽略","亚马逊向部分卖家群发“无批发分销（NWD）”计划下的商品移除通知，经客服核实该消息为系统自动发送，适用于所有关联卖家。若账户持有品牌代表角色，则不会面临停用风险，可直接忽略；非品牌代表需尽快获取授权，否则2026年10月27日后库存将被移除。",{"_117":480},"2026-10-20T18:39:00.000Z","2026-10-21T09:41:08.911Z",[113,114,597],{"_109":479,"_111":112},[637],{"_97":98,"_99":356,"_101":357,"_103":358,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5,"_108":-5},"wde6g36eie3i7b60trgdrpdi8","亚马逊推多渠道工具整合 eBay 等数据，作者质疑卖家共享意愿","亚马逊推出新的多渠道工具，旨在将 eBay、Shopify、TikTok 和 Walmart 的商品详情页、订单及利润数据整合至 Seller Central。作者指出该功能虽提供便利，但质疑卖家是否愿意向亚马逊开放其他销售渠道的数据。",{"_117":433},"2026-10-20T19:45:38.000Z","2026-10-20T20:15:41.290Z",[135,196,114,520],[],{"_380":422,"_382":423,"_384":424,"_386":425,"_93":647,"_389":-5},[648],{"_97":98,"_99":649,"_101":650,"_103":651,"_105":652,"_106":653,"_107":-5,"_108":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",719,548,"g673jzl01inbiu8f9x4evz3r4","亚马逊欧洲10站燃油物流附加费上调至2% 11月旺季生效","亚马逊宣布自2026年11月2日起将欧洲10个站点的FBA燃油及物流附加费从1.5%上调至2%，MCF服务自11月19日起执行。计费基数为配送费，平台称平均每件增加约0.02欧元，作者分析指出这收回了年初降费的约四成，且因按百分比计算会与旺季配送费叠加，大件重货受影响更大。",